<section class="relative pt-20 pb-40 px-6 overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center min-h-[90vh] bg-primary-container clip-slant z-10">
	<div class="absolute -left-20 top-1/4 w-[500px] h-[400px] bg-action-emerald/10 rounded-[4rem] rounded-bl-none -z-10 rotate-12"></div>
	<div class="absolute -right-40 bottom-10 w-[600px] h-[500px] bg-secondary-container/10 rounded-[5rem] rounded-br-none -z-10 -rotate-6"></div>

	<!-- Floating Decorative Elements -->
	<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[64px] text-action-emerald/20 absolute top-[15%] left-[10%] animate-float-slow -z-10" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">chat_bubble</span>
	<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[80px] text-secondary-container/15 absolute bottom-[25%] left-[15%] animate-float-medium -z-10" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">forum</span>
	<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[48px] text-primary-fixed/25 absolute top-[30%] right-[12%] animate-float-fast -z-10" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">mark_chat_read</span>
	<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[96px] text-soft-mint/10 absolute bottom-[20%] right-[8%] animate-float-slow -z-10" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">leaderboard</span>

	<div class="max-w-[1000px] mx-auto flex flex-col items-center z-10 relative">
		<img alt="Mércure Elo Logo" class="h-[435px] w-auto mb-8 drop-shadow-2xl animate-pulse" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBCSeOUylEWihmedRuN803ckgk2yVKauk7yljRnKPXvFQ7XfSNH4I4zwQJmkGcYEViccgcS5Llmh-w7Je60ArnrZwUv-Iy5B3HaIEwChuaDWZfKIckJ8IYKrb6Llkoc_ezSYBeqgpm-ZSUFBh0bq62bJrd9f-HyiH7eTTLGjc5-CDaPgYdtIUYrAieJ7amXrEKzPA0E4O1Q1bmm6NmjbiwqGW6boFsguhOrb_sDktuGlh6IDwIc-HjLxk0NSCyW3rE8">
		<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest/10 border border-pure-white/20 text-on-primary-container font-label-lg text-label-lg mb-8 shadow-lg backdrop-blur-sm">
			<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] text-secondary-container">stars</span>
			Feito para pequenos negócios e artesãos
		</div>
		<h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl-mobile md:text-headline-xl text-pure-white mb-8 leading-tight max-w-4xl drop-shadow-md">
			Aproximando você dos seus clientes de forma <span class="text-secondary-container relative inline-block">fácil
				<svg class="absolute -bottom-3 left-0 w-full h-4 text-action-emerald opacity-80" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 100 10"><path d="M0 5 Q 50 10 100 5" fill="transparent" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="6"></path></svg>
			</span>
		</h1>
		<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-primary-container mb-12 max-w-3xl drop-shadow-sm">
			Automatize sua comunicação no WhatsApp sem perder a essência. Ferramentas poderosas de gestão e engajamento que parecem artesanais.
		</p>
		<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 w-full sm:w-auto">
			<button class="bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container hover:bg-primary-fixed active:scale-95 transition-all duration-300 rounded-full px-10 py-5 font-label-lg text-label-lg shadow-[0_10px_40px_rgba(146,247,195,0.3)] hover:shadow-[0_15px_50px_rgba(146,247,195,0.4)] flex items-center justify-center gap-3 w-full sm:w-auto text-lg">
				Começar Agora
				<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">rocket_launch</span>
			</button>
			<button class="border-2 border-primary-fixed text-primary-fixed hover:bg-primary-fixed/10 active:scale-95 transition-all duration-300 rounded-full px-10 py-5 font-label-lg text-label-lg w-full sm:w-auto text-lg backdrop-blur-sm">
				Ver Demonstração
			</button>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
